. 
. *** Build the SUBGROUPS macro for downstream DiD loops. Derive from the
. *** column names (more robust than re-reading the crosswalk here).
. ds share_*
share_alco~l  share_dura~t  share_fo~try  share_hous~g  share_rec_~m
share_bev_~a  share_du~les  share_fo~ats  share_hous~l  share_rec_~s
